                                                "sense_id": "aaea211c-1198-3f4a-9f70-562c1ea2b6e7",
                                                "text": "So ended this great siege, the most memorable in the annals of the British isles. It had lasted a hundred and five days"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55aa4712-3336-4fde-a1c3-f8975d3c4338",
                                                "sense_id": "aaea211c-1198-3f4a-9f70-562c1ea2b6e7",
